+++ b/releasenotes/notes/wait-exponential-cap-power-a3f09c2d7e51b848.yaml
@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+---
+fixes:
+  - |
+    ``wait_exponential`` no longer computes the exponential power once the wait
+    has reached ``max``. Long-running retries with integer arguments previously
+    kept growing the power on every attempt, which made them progressively slower.
+    The returned waits are unchanged.
